  :author "claude-1"
  :status :draft
  :refs ["futon3c/holes/labs/M-futon-seams/exemplar/click-001.edn"]
  :body "FINDING for Clause T. The mission declares two orderings and this is not the one that chose the target. This ranks KINDS of retrofit by expense; the target was chosen by the IDENTIFY exit's separate ranking, on 'smallest surface' and 'unblocks provider substitution for Rob immediately'. Applied to instances, this ordering does not discriminate \u2014 4, 5 and 7 are all rank-2 code retrofits. It is also ambiguous in the direction that matters: 'worst' can mean most expensive to fix, which argues for doing it last, or most damaging, which argues for first. The record says :entered-as :not-used; the ambiguity should be resolved here in the mission before a later click tries to use it as a prior."}
