  :refs ["futon3c/holes/labs/M-futon-seams/exemplar/click-001-outcome.edn"]
  :body "WHY the grains diverged, and it is not carelessness. The implementer worked from the mission's defect description \u2014 the provider parsed out of the id, the http.clj sites \u2014 rather than from the chosen cascade, and nothing in the loop checked the enactment against the candidate before it was committed. The outcome record states the gap: PROOF-2a has no clause binding the enacted change to the chosen candidate. Clause 4's Q-link joins action to outcome to next belief, but 'action' means the selected candidate, and nothing checks that what was done IS that candidate. A click can pass every clause and build something else."}
